Tests event-driven ingestion, data validation, and idempotent loading with minimal IAM.

## Key Concepts
- GCS finalize triggers in Cloud Functions
- Pub/Sub as decoupled ingest buffer
- BigQuery date-partitioned tables and streaming inserts
- insertId-based idempotency
- Least-privilege IAM and a straightforward test plan

